<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial">The last payment on your settlement agreement was returned as a stop pay. We scheduled it to re-run for a second time but the payment was again returned for stop pay. Please contact me as soon as possible as you are in default of your settlement agreement. If we do not hear from you we will move forward with enforcing the terms of the settlement agreement and seek to recover our attorney’s fees and costs for such efforts.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I look forward to hearing from you.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Best Regards,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
